# Current proof boundary and unapproved alternatives, not an executable algorithm.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Before a directory open\nRoot / link / registration / queued / current\nSame charged component walker" {class: start}
Probe: "No-follow child status through checked parent\nDirectory device / identity, or link identity\nProbe safety itself awaits signed acceptance"
Proof: "Required pre-open proofs established?\nDevice belongs to permitted mount witness\nProtected / cloud aliases ruled out" {shape: diamond}
Open: "Only a proved permitted transition\nA = parent; B = child\nRecheck association / mounted metadata"
Mount: "Bootstrap gap\nDescriptor mount / capability calls need an open\nFixed pathname is no unknown-device permission"
AliasGap: "Policy-link gap\nNo-follow status is not target identity\nWork/Docs can redirect to already opened Work"
Blocked: "Proved blocked ancestor\nStop route before its open\nText prefix alone proves no final confinement"
Stop: "Do not open to discover the missing proof\nDependency scope: root / exact target / link\nRefused registration prevents UNREGISTERED"
Decision: "Metadata-policy decision required\nRecommend narrow public-metadata design revision\nPreserve domain / accounts / Q/S / wait"
Proposal: "Unapproved candidates\nCached bounded getfsstat MNT_NOWAIT\nFixed-policy target-following fstatat\nStaleness / bounds / foreign lookup / prompts unresolved"
Return: "Returned witness design + mandatory review\nThen replay/size phases → classification\nNo native / useful-coverage / binary pass"
Start -> Probe: "1 · gate and charge"
Probe -> Proof: "2 · establish, never infer"
Proof -> Open: "3 · complete and permitted"
Proof -> Blocked: "3 · blocked"
Proof -> Mount: "3 · missing mount"
Proof -> AliasGap: "3 · missing target alias"
Mount -> Stop: "4 · no speculative bootstrap"
AliasGap -> Stop: "4 · no literal-only fallback"
Blocked -> Stop: "4 · keep outside alias obligation if needed"
Stop -> Decision: "5 · expose policy choice"
Decision -> Proposal: "6 · alternatives for approval"
Proposal -> Return: "7 · only after decision; not permission to call"
